    <string name="section_reference">Command reference</string>
    <string name="reference_text">“Hey Partner” (or any of your wake phrases), then:\n\n
• Lock my phone / screen\n
• Play / pause / resume / next song / previous song\n
• Call [name] / Dial [name]\n
• Open / launch [app name]\n
• Flashlight on / off\n
• Volume up / down / max / mute\n
• Take a screenshot\n
• Go home / Show recents / Open notifications / Quick settings\n
• What time is it / What’s the date / Battery level\n
• Set alarm for 7:30 AM / Timer for 5 minutes\n
• Silent mode on / off (ringer)\n
• Brightness 50 (percent)\n
• Find my phone\n
• Go to sleep (stop listening)\n
• Help\n\n
Plus your custom commands from the list above.</string>

